target: session manifest written: <TMP>/home/.fno/spaces/<TMPD_REPO>/target-state.md
node:                fresh (no node bound)
attended:            true (manifest, live: owner_pid alive)
worktree:            on canonical main -- create with: fno do target start <node>
tests:               unknown | resolve: set your repo's test command
plan:                none (no plan bound)
boundary-reconcile:  fresh (no node bound)
manifest-live:       live (owner_pid alive)
done-when:           PR + CI green + reviewed by [none (PR + CI only)] (optional if present: [chatgpt-codex-connector]); self-review required for code (unknown): run `/fno:review <level> --comment` (the lane emits its own attestation; `bash skills/review/scripts/emit-attestation.sh code-review` is the recovery path when emission fails); on refusal, report the literal refusal and stop
